# Public site address without trailing slash, e.g. https://barmint.example.
# Link previews (WhatsApp, Slack, LinkedIn…) need an absolute image URL.
# While empty, the preview image path is relative and some apps won't show it.
# Applied to dist/index.html after `ng build` by scripts/site-url.mjs; an environment
# variable SITE_URL (used in GitHub Actions) takes precedence over this file.
SITE_URL=
